        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">REporting checklist for FoundatIon and large laNguagE models</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The REporting checklist for FoundatIon and large laNguagE models (REFINE) is an international Delphi-based reporting guideline for studies that use foundation models (FMs) and large language models (LLMs) in medical research.</skos:definition>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


